                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 3691/87.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Combs to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-02-22"><hi rendition="#italic">February 22,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Reports that the minister for foreign affairs of Honduras telegraphs that
                    Nicaragua, by its invasion of Honduras, has terminated pending negotiations for
                    pacific settlement.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
